{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/pulls/5","id":4976806612,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVMOJWc8AAAABKKQK1A","html_url":"https://github.com/senzenn/idl-drift/pull/5","diff_url":"https://github.com/senzenn/idl-drift/pull/5.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/senzenn/idl-drift/pull/5.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/issues/5","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/pulls/5/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/pulls/5/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/issues/5/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/senzenn/idl-drift/statuses/7c056b65cf3e5892d1154978211e49cb16a06272","number":5,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(drift): check the program id in declare_id!, Anchor.toml, the IDL and on chain","user":{"login":"senzenn","id":185802908,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxMgnA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185802908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn","html_url":"https://github.com/senzenn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"#### Problem\n\nCloses #1. An Anchor workspace keeps the program id in four places: `declare_id!`, `Anchor.toml`, the IDL `address` and the chain. A new keypair or a move to another cluster can change one copy and not the others. Each copy is in a different file, so a review of one file does not find the drift.\n\n#### Summary of Changes\n\n- New command: `idl-drift source [ROOT] [--idl PATH]... [--onchain] [--json | --markdown] [--fail-on TIER]`. The exit codes are the same as for `diff`.\n- New library module `idl_drift::source`: `discover`, `read_idl`, `check` and `check_onchain`. The caller gives the RPC call to `check_onchain`.\n- `declare_id!` is the reference. A different id in `Anchor.toml`, in an IDL or on chain is Breaking. The rules and tiers are in `docs/idl-drift.md`, section `source`.\n- `source` reads only regular files under ROOT, each up to 16 MiB. It reads an IDL address from the raw JSON, so an IDL that `diff` cannot load still gives its id.\n- `onchain.rs`: a crate-private `fetch_text` reads the on-chain IDL text before the model parses it.\n- Action: `command: source`. The job log filter now replaces control characters in linear time. The `idl` and `allow` inputs must resolve to a path in the workspace.\n\n#### Testing\n\n- `tests/source.rs` tests the library, with a closure as fake RPC. `tests/source_cli.rs` tests the binary, with a local RPC mock.\n- `cargo test --workspace`: 328 passed. `cargo clippy -D warnings`, `cargo +1.91 check` and `integration/run-all.sh` (33/33) pass.\n- 61 real Anchor workspaces (`anchor/tests/*` and three Jupiter repositories): Breaking only for `declare-id` and `safety-checks`, which have real drift. No run exits 2.\n- Live mainnet: `source --onchain` on a workspace for pump AMM finds the program and its IDL account, and gives no finding.\n- Two review rounds (security, performance, correctness) checked this change. Each problem that they found has a test or a case in the end-to-end script.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:15:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T14:29:16Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T13:51:03Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T13:51:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"acd5814e1ebcb335edebc7486480f821a8c3b79f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"senzenn:feat/source","ref":"feat/source","repo":{"id":1422100825,"node_id":"R_kgDOVMOJWQ","name":"idl-drift","full_name":"senzenn/idl-drift","owner":{"login":"senzenn","id":185802908,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxMgnA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185802908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn","html_url":"https://github.com/senzenn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/senzenn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"language":"Rust","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":5,"watchers_count":5,"watchers":5,"open_issues_count":1,"open_issues":1,"size":1047,"default_branch":"main","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_downloads":false,"has_discussions":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pushed_at":"2026-10-23T14:32:44Z","created_at":"2026-10-16T11:57:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T14:32:13Z","allow_forking":true,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Ap